From 813faff8b3464005b4fcb2d0cd557c7107624806 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: lunatickochiya <125438787@qq.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 08:25:55 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 8/9] luci-app-dockerman: sync with istoreos-25.12

- handle Docker multiplexed streams in JS API and rpcd
- add max concurrent downloads and USTC registry mirror
- set MemorySwap=-1 when a memory limit is configured
- wrap container log output and extend uhttpd script timeout
- mark the package as hold
- add zh_Hans/zh_Hant translations for the new options
